message: "If you use ShinyValidator in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "ShinyValidator"
type: software
version: "2.1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23350855"
repository-code: "https://github.com/manybabies/ShinyValidator"
url: "https://manybabies.shinyapps.io/shinyvalidator/"
abstract: "ShinyValidator is a customizable R Shiny tool for checking research datasets against predefined data specifications. Users upload a CSV, review the validation results and suggested fixes, and download a highlighted Excel file and an authenticated, validated CSV."
keywords:
  - data validation
  - R Shiny
  - research data
  - data quality
